      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fayette_City%2C_Pennsylvania",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Mining began in 1830 with the Cardondelet, Furlong, and Snow Hill mines, and by the early 1900s over twenty mines operated around Fayette City.",
